<h3 class="ccu-section-title"><?=ccu_icon('terminal')?>_(Workspaces)_</h3>
<p class="ccu-section-desc">The directories under the data directory's <code>work/</code> folder. Open terminal starts Unraid's web terminal there: type <code>claude</code> for a session, or <code>claude-unraid start &lt;workspace&gt;</code> for a supervised one.</p>
